💡 **PRO TIP**: You can use the `query_app_atlas` tool to retrieve structural UI maps (Atlas) for known applications (e.g. Navicat). Use this to find menu paths or button locations without excessive exploration.
{% if has_android %}
💡 **PRO TIP**: For sequential Android tasks, use the `intent_flow` action in `mobile_control`. It executes a list of clicks/inputs locally at high frequency (10Hz), dramatically reducing execution time and bypassing UI animation delays between steps.
{% endif %}
💡 **PRO TIP**: For web automation, `browser_control` is dramatically more reliable than `desktop_control` + OCR. It supports CSS selectors, JS execution, and cookie management. The browser starts automatically on first use—no manual launch needed.
{% endif %}
